  "howToCreateListing": "How do I create a listing?",
  "createListingAnswer": "To create a listing, tap the \"Share\" button on the home screen, take photos of your item, add a title and description, and publish your listing. Your listing will be visible to people nearby.",
  "howToAddFavorites": "How do I add items to favorites?",
  "addFavoritesAnswer": "Tap the heart icon on any listing to add it to your favorites. You can view all your saved items in the \"Favorites\" section of your profile.",
  "howToContactSeller": "How do I contact a giver?",
  "contactSellerAnswer": "Tap the \"Send Message\" button on the listing detail page to start a chat with the giver. Use messaging to ask questions and arrange pickup.",
  "whyLocationServices": "Why are location services needed?",
  "locationServicesAnswer": "Location services help show you nearby listings and suggest safe meeting points. This saves you time and fuel by connecting you with givers in your community.",
  "howToStaySafe": "How can I stay safe when meeting for pickup?",
  "staySafeAnswer": "Always meet in public places like coffee shops or shopping centers. Avoid meeting alone at night and trust your instincts. GarageLoop recommends well-lit, busy areas.",
  "howToEditListing": "How do I edit my listing?",
  "editListingAnswer": "Go to \"My Listings\" in your profile. Tap the \"Edit\" button next to the listing you want to modify and make your changes.",
  "howDoPaymentsWork": "How does free sharing work?",
  "paymentsAnswer": "All items are free to give and claim. Connect with the giver, arrange a safe pickup, and pass items along when you no longer need them.",
  "howToDeleteAccount": "How do I delete my account?",
  "deleteAccountAnswer": "Go to Settings > Privacy & Security > Delete Account. Please note that this action is permanent and cannot be undone.",
  "howToReportIssue": "How do I report an issue?",
  "reportIssueAnswer": "Go to Settings > Help & Support > Contact Support to report bugs or get help with any issues you're experiencing."
